IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MEDIA-TRANSPORT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 QUIC-VERSION        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 GZIP-BYTES          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 PNG-WIDTH           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 TRANSPORT-SCORE     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-MEDIA-TRANSPORT.
    IF QUIC-VERSION < 1
        GO TO MEDIA-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF GZIP-BYTES == 0
        GO TO MEDIA-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF PNG-WIDTH == 0
        GO TO MEDIA-ERROR.
    END-IF.


    MOVE 9980 TO TRANSPORT-SCORE.
    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 QUIC-VERSION.
    WEIGHT 30 GZIP-BYTES.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

MEDIA-ERROR.
    MOVE 0 TO TRANSPORT-SCORE.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
